Template: ddns-dynv6/interface
Type: string
Default: 
Description: Network interface to monitor for IPv6 address changes:
 Enter the name of the network interface that should be monitored for IPv6 
 address changes (e.g., eno1, eth0, enp3s0).
 .
 You can find available interfaces with: ip link

Template: ddns-dynv6/token
Type: string
Default: 
Description: Your dynv6 API token:
 Enter your dynv6 API token. You can get one from https://dynv6.com/
 after creating a free account.
 .
 This token is required to authenticate DNS update requests.

Template: ddns-dynv6/domains
Type: string
Default: 
Description: Domain(s) to update:
 Enter the dynv6 domain(s) to update when IPv6 address changes.
 For multiple domains, separate them with spaces.
 .
 Example: myhost.dynv6.net